3764
02:35:33.260 --> 02:35:35.400
Like just if you get these three things in

3765
02:35:35.400 --> 02:35:37.830
on whatever days and then if you have extra time,

3766
02:35:37.830 --> 02:35:39.630
you can work this in, but if you can't,

3767
02:35:39.630 --> 02:35:42.690
don't worry about it because the core is taken care of.

3768
02:35:42.690 --> 02:35:44.015
Exactly.

3769
02:35:44.015 --> 02:35:45.810
All right my friend.

3770
02:35:45.810 --> 02:35:48.820
Well, I appreciate the guidance as always.

